    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[## What is CC Switch?

A desktop application for managing and switching between coding agents, covering Claude
Code, Codex, OpenCode and others from one window.

Upstream also publishes a portable zip. This package installs the MSI, so Windows records
the install and Chocolatey can uninstall it cleanly.
]]></description>
    <summary>CC Switch is a desktop assistant for switching between coding agents such as Claude Code, Codex and OpenCode.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch/releases/tag/v3.20.2</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright 2025 Jason Young</copyright>
